{
  "version": "acceptance-v5-offline",
  "frozen_note": "All v4 scenario IDs and input turns retained, plus eight manual multi-turn regressions; changed presentation expectations are recorded under presentation_changes. Real-model v5 acceptance is pending; selfcheck is scripted, never model-quality evidence.",
